  "changes": [
    "Per-instance ObservedAbsenceModel replaces process globals; nested passes freeze the same owning model. Loading replaces statistics rather than accumulating them.",
    "Evidence checkpoint now saves population, live state keys, query geometry, local calibration, processed watermark and latest per-cell identity/absence evidence; retired detailed caches are released. Backend saves/loads evidence_state.cbor, bound to the output bundle.",
    "Actual state support determines evidence validity across sessions; input boundary remains a processing boundary. Geometry signatures and sampling contract revisions trigger rebuilding current-session measurements.",
    "Removed 162-line countPhysicalSurface mesh-ray proxy state decision and the separate projected min-fraction gate. Existing session check helper now calls production countCurrentPhysicalSurface with actual ownership fields.",
    "State M001 temporal guard and promotion share latestSupport/isEligibleSuccessor. Geometry revisions increment on merge and persist in registry checkpoint schema2. Complete evidence cache replaces birth-only scalars; current-round evidence carries key/revision/watermark.",
    "Terminal ready is set only after the required surface update completes; missing archives and failed maps throw before publication. Surface error output is mandatory.",
    "Immutable output directory is claimed via durable O_EXCL protocol marker before writes; partial output cannot downgrade to legacy, complete bundle includes per-file lengths/SHA and timestamp binding.",
    "Project map load/query helpers are used by viewer/export/inspection/audit and old standalone runner. Dynamic viewer honors requested snapshot index; client confirmed requests each index.",
    "Only tracked native modifications are thin backend prepare/save handoffs, declarations/state transport and project evidence accessor. Own native D1/D2 bodies retained.",
    "No compilation/tests/offline/online this turn; git diff --check passed. Two existing agents reviewed then implemented focused portions; they are not fresh final independent acceptance reviewers."
  ],
